name: ['Assembled Alphas', "Heron's Grace Champion", 'Identity Thief', 'Niblis of Frost', 'Noosegraf Mob', 'Sanctifier of Souls', 'Thalia, Heretic Cathar', 'Ulvenwald Observer', 'Unsubstantiate']
